142 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 66 0 R/E(There are hundreds of models, big differences in price, and an ever-growing list of features such as AI, Bluetooth, rechargeable batteries, smartphone apps, speech enhancement and discreet designs.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[3]>>
