<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 66 0 R/E(I\220m Lachlan Smith, Senior Clinical Audiologist and founder of TellyHear. I have worked in audiology for more than 15 years, helping people choose, fit and adjust hearing aids from the world\220s leading manufacturers.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

146 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 66 0 R/E(At TellyHear, we work with brands including Phonak, Oticon, Starkey, Widex, ReSound, Signia, Unitron and Beltone. That gives us a broad view of the market and, importantly, means we are not limited to recommending one brand.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

147 0 obj
