148 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 66 0 R/E(The right choice depends on your hearing, lifestyle and priorities. Someone who regularly spends time in restaurants and meetings may need very different technology from someone with a quieter lifestyle. Another person may care most about discretion, Bluetooth connectivity or battery life.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

