endobj

217 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 70 0 R/E(Designed for more active and social lifestyles. They generally offer stronger processing in background noise and more automatic adjustment across different environments.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

218 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 70 0 R/T(Elite)/E(Elite)/Pg 16 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

