<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 70 0 R/E(From around $2,995 per aid)/Pg 16 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

220 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 70 0 R/E(The highest technology level, with the most advanced processing and features available. Best suited to people who regularly spend time in demanding listening environments.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

221 0 obj
