233 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 71 0 R/E(Someone who mainly wants help at home may need very different technology from someone who regularly attends restaurants, meetings and social events.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

234 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 71 0 R/T(The best hearing aid is not necessarily the most expensive one. It is the one that best matches the way you actually live.)/E(The best hearing aid is not necessarily the most expensive one. It is the one that best matches the way you actually live.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

