240 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 72 0 R/T(What Does AI Actually Do?)/E(What Does AI Actually Do?)/Pg 18 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

241 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 72 0 R/E(AI has become one of the biggest developments in modern hearing aids, but the basic idea is simple.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

242 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 72 0 R/E(Modern hearing aids constantly analyse the sounds around you. AI and machine learning can help them recognise different environments, separate speech from competing noise and make more intelligent adjustments automatically.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

243 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 72 0 R/T(AI can help with  understanding your surroundings, identifying whether you are in a quiet room, a busy restaurant or another complex environment and adjust the hearing aid accordingly.)/E(AI can help with  understanding your surroundings, identifying whether you are in a quiet room, a busy restaurant or another complex environment and adjust the hearing aid accordingly.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

244 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 72 0 R/E(Making speech easier to follow)/Pg 18 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

245 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 72 0 R/E(Some AI-based systems are designed to give greater priority to speech when background noise increases.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

246 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 72 0 R/T(Not all AI is the same)/E(Not all AI is the same)/Pg 18 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

247 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 72 0 R/E(Different manufacturers use AI in different ways. Some focus more on recognising listening environments, while others use deep neural networks to help separate speech from noise or improve automatic processing.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

248 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 72 0 R/E(So instead of asking: \215Does this hearing aid have AI?\216 Ask: \215What is the AI actually helping me hear better?\216)/Pg 18 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

249 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 72 0 R/T(What AI cannot do)/E(What AI cannot do)/Pg 18 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

250 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 72 0 R/E(AI cannot restore natural hearing, remove every unwanted sound or replace proper fitting and programming.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

251 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 72 0 R/E(For people who regularly spend time in restaurants, meetings and other complex environments, advanced AI processing may be valuable. For simpler listening needs, paying more just because a device carries an \215AI\216 label may not be necessary.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

252 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 72 0 R/E(AI HEARING AIDS)/Pg 18 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

253 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 72 0 R/E(Buy AI for the problem it solves, not because the label sounds impressive.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[14]>>
