endobj

259 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 73 0 R/E(The important thing is not how long the feature list is. It is whether those features solve problems you actually have. For most buyers, I would pay particular attention to:)/Pg 19 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

260 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 73 0 R/T(Speech in noise: If restaurants, family gatherings or meetings are difficult, this should be one of your highest priorities.)/E(Speech in noise: If restaurants, family gatherings or meetings are difficult, this should be one of your highest priorities.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

261 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 73 0 R/T(AI/Automatic processing: Modern hearing aids can analyse your surroundings and adjust automatically as the listening environment changes. This becomes more valuable the more varied your lifestyle is.)/E(AI/Automatic processing: Modern hearing aids can analyse your surroundings and adjust automatically as the listening environment changes. This becomes more valuable the more varied your lifestyle is.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

262 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 73 0 R/T(Rechargeability: For many people, being able to charge hearing aids overnight instead of handling small disposable batteries is a major convenience.)/E(Rechargeability: For many people, being able to charge hearing aids overnight instead of handling small disposable batteries is a major convenience.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[5]>>
