299 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E(A RIC sits behind the ear with a thin wire leading to a receiver inside the ear canal. RICs are one of the most popular styles because they combine small size, discretion and access to modern technology. They are commonly rechargeable and often include Bluetooth, app control and advanced sound processing.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[4]>>
